==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Trust Fund}}

==Battleground==
*10 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croconator]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Ribbo]] spawns after 9.33 seconds<sup>280f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*7 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*7 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns as the boss after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Ribbo]] spawns after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Due to the more spammy nature of enemies compared to the previous two rounds, less heavy hitters/more disposable units work well. For example, you can use [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]], [[Housewife Cat]], [[Bakery Cat (Rare Cat)|Fried Chicken Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]

Any good combos, like Land-Air Assault ([[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Flying]] + [[Mighty Deth-Troy-R (Uber Rare Cat)|Diabaolosa]]) will work well here.

# For Ribbo, bring a barrier breaker like [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|The Kitty of Liberty]] or use the [[Cat Cannon|breakerblast cat cannon]] to save a slot.
# For Zuche, use Bullet Train to stop it from burrowing, use housewife, or use slime.
# For Sleipnir, ramen and some longer ranged units of your choice will work fine.
'''NOTE:'''

You can stack LD/wavers/surgers on the first Ribbo. Just keep a barrier breaker handy.

